# Prototype presets

This plugin is still a prototype. Saved `.doomgazer` files, DAW sessions, MIDI maps, and host automation are reset with each update. They are not a compatibility target.

- Add, remove, or reorder parameters when the sound needs it. Update `Parameters`, the factory table in `FactoryPresets.cpp`, and any test that names the current set in the same change.
- Do not add migration, versioned unpacking, or spare slots so an older bank still loads.
- Factory presets compiled into the plugin are the current sounds. Edit them freely. Do not keep a behavior so a previously saved slot still matches.
